# 12 - Domain Indicators (2 domains)
alert dns any any -> any any (msg:"APT 12 - Malicious Domain Activity"; dns.query; pcre:"/^(icc\.ignorelist\.com|video\.csmcpr\.com)$/i"; classtype:trojan-activity; sid:9000000; rev:1; metadata:apt_group 12;)

# 12 - IPv4 Indicators (1 IPs)
